# M3L3 — Hooks & quality gates

Deterministic checks run via **`.cursor/hooks.json`** (`afterFileEdit`), not via prompt reminders.

| Layer | When | Command |
| ----- | ---- | ------- |
| Format | per edit | `node scripts/hooks/prettier-after-edit.mjs` |
| Typecheck | per edit + pre-commit | `node scripts/hooks/typecheck-after-edit.mjs` / lefthook `typecheck-*` |
| Auth tests | per edit in `core/auth/**` | `node scripts/hooks/test-auth-after-edit.mjs` |
| Functions tests | per edit in `functions/src/**` (≠ `.test.ts`) | `node scripts/hooks/test-functions-after-edit.mjs` |

- Hook scripts parse Cursor stdin JSON field **`file_path`**.
- **Exit code 2** = blocking error (typecheck/test failure).
- No root ESLint — Prettier + `tsc --noEmit` only.
- Full CI unchanged: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` → `build` + `test`.
- Verify: Cursor **Hooks** output channel; manual: `npm run hooks:verify`.

Claude Code equivalent: `docs/hooks-claude-code-equivalent.json` (PostToolUse + `tool_input.file_path`).
